  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Macadamia Nut Prod. &amp; Marketing Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of its development objectives of crop diversification and improvement in incomes and welfare of smalholders the GOM wishes to promote smallholder farmer macadamia production. To facilitate the achievements of these objectives, the GOM wishes to implement a feasibility study to assist the Government in formulating a project proposal for the production, processing and marketing of macadamia nuts on smallholder farms.</narrative>
  </description>
